# Privacy Policy

Version: 1.0.2  
Last Updated: 2026-04-30

## 1. Introduction
This Privacy Policy explains how “Jovović Shop” ("we", "us", "our") collects, uses, stores, and protects personal data of app users.

## 2. Controller and Contact
- Controller: Jovović Shop  
- Data protection contact: gsx.studi@gmail.com

## 3. Data We Collect
- Account data: full name, email, phone number, address, city, postal code, profile photo (if provided).  
- Authentication data: if you use email/password sign-in, your password is processed within Firebase Authentication (we do not store “plain text” passwords in the app).  
- Technical data: device type, device/installation identifiers, error and performance logs; IP address may be recorded in service provider logs (e.g., Google/Firebase) as part of standard infrastructure logging.  
- Purchase data: items, amounts, order statuses, order history, vouchers.  
- “Price on request” offer data: product identifier, offered price, offer status and expiry, related conversation/message identifiers, and technical offer identifiers.  
- Notifications: FCM token for push notifications.

## 4. Legal Basis for Processing
We process data based on:  
- contract performance (Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR) – registration, purchases, delivery, support;  
- legitimate interests (Art. 6(1)(f)) – service security and abuse prevention;  
- consent (Art. 6(1)(a)) – marketing notifications, where applicable.

## 5. Purposes of Processing
- creating and maintaining user accounts;  
- fulfilling orders and communicating order status;  
- creating and managing automated offers for “price on request” products, including anti-abuse controls and offer-validity checks during checkout;  
- sending important notices (e.g., terms changes, security messages);  
- improving the app and user experience;  
- complying with legal obligations.

## 6. Data Retention
We retain data as long as necessary for the purposes described in this Policy or as required by law. Account data is retained until the account is deleted or a deletion request is made. “Price on request” offer records may be retained for a limited period for security, audit, and dispute-resolution purposes (e.g., used/expired offer statuses up to 30 days), after which they are deleted or anonymized according to retention policies.

## 7. Data Sharing
We may share data with:  
- service providers (e.g., hosting, notifications) under appropriate data processing agreements;  
- authorities when required by law;  
- in business transfers (merger, acquisition) with adequate safeguards.

## 8. International Transfers
Where data is transferred outside the EEA, we implement appropriate safeguards (e.g., EU Standard Contractual Clauses or adequacy decisions).

## 9. Data Security
We apply technical and organizational measures (encryption, access control, audit logs, security checks) to protect your data.

## 10. Your Rights
Under the GDPR you have the right to:  
- access, rectification, and erasure;  
- restriction of processing and objection;  
- data portability;  
- withdraw consent (where processing is based on consent).  
Requests: gsx.studi@gmail.com

## 11. Cookies and Similar Technologies
The app may use device identifiers and similar technologies to provide functionality (e.g., notifications, performance). Details may appear in app settings or a separate cookie notice, where applicable.

## 12. Changes to this Policy
We may update this Policy. For material changes, we will notify you in the app or via email. “Last Updated” shows the effective date of the current version.

## 13. Contact
For privacy questions/requests: gsx.studi@gmail.com

