## 15. Obligation to provide data
Certain data is necessary to conclude and perform the contract (account creation and purchases). If you do not provide required data, we may be unable to deliver the service.

## 16. Automated decision-making
The app uses limited automation (e.g., technical generation of “price on request” offers and offer-validity checks), but we do not engage in automated decision-making, including profiling, that produces legal effects or similarly significantly affects you.

## 17. Sources of data not obtained from you
Some technical information is received automatically from your device/app. When using third-party sign-in (e.g., Google/OAuth), we receive identification data from those providers to the extent necessary for authentication.

